2. Calculate the spacing based on the size of the input fields or text elements, and set it programmatically for each word.

If you want to adjust the spacing dynamically based on the screen size or other factors, you can modify the code to calculate the spacing value accordingly and assign it to `layoutGroup.spacing`.

