In this updated code:
- The `OnFieldValueChanged` method ensures that the input focus moves to the next field in order.
- The `ClearFields` method removes all instantiated objects and clears the input fields and correct characters lists.
- The `IsSentenceCorrect` method calls `ClearFields` and `Init` to reload the words after the first incorrect attempt.
- The `NextButton` and `fakeNextButton` switch between each other on every incorrect attempt.
- The `NextButton` becomes interactable when any field is changed and all fields are filled.

